WEBVTT

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:12.560
Haru-sama!

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:13.980
Aki-sama!

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:15.280
Haru-sama!

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:16.580
They're so annoying.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:16.860
Aki-sama!

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:19.250
They're becoming a 
neighborhood nuisance, too.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.670
Nice to see you guys again today!

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:23.120
Please take one of these!

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.970
They're coupons for our bath!

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:25.830
Thanks!

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:27.170
Thanks a bunch!

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:29.000
Great job, Yumoto.

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:31.030
That's very considerate of you.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:34.400
It's him!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.520
Haru, I know what you're thinking.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.750
Aki, you feel the same way?

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:41.720
Yes...

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:43.680
We are not amused.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.700
So why not just get rid of him?

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:25.790
The Synchronicity of Love

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:30.120
Oh yeah, senpai!

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:33.470
You hear this a lot at barbers 
and beauty shops and stuff.

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:36.010
"Do you feel itchy anywhere?"

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:38.990
I guess you still do hear that.

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:42.600
Yeah, that's a line you only 
hear at places like that.

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:47.120
But I hear twins know that 
kind of thing without asking!

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:49.710
If their twin is feeling itchy or something.

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:50.280
Seriously?

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:51.200
Seriously!

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:53.170
Which means they can seriously 
scratch anywhere they feel itchy?

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:54.870
They seriously can!

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:56.660
Twins are amazing, huh?

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:59.250
They know just where the other feels itchy!

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:04.220
Hey Atsushi, why are we talking about twins?

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:06.830
It's probably because of those Italian twins

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:10.880
transferring here right on the 
heels of the Beppu Siblings.

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:12.260
Another set of twins?

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:14.290
And why are they Italian?

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.800
That's a very good question.

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:20.160
They're the Salvatores, 
and they're really rugged.

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:22.770
When you say "rugged," you 
mean their facial features?

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:24.640
What else could he mean?

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:27.220
Well, lots of other things...

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.960
Like sideburns or chest hair, or something.

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:32.190
Yeah, I bet they've got that.

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:35.570
They say someone rich in 
hair is also rich in spirit.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:37.270
Is that true?

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:38.900
I don't know.

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:39.900
I think it's an old wives tale?

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:43.060
Rich in hair means rich in spirit?

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:45.370
I guess that's why Gora is like that!

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:48.720
Gora is hairy?

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.830
He doesn't give off that vibe...

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:52.740
Well, he's hairier than me!

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:55.720
That's just because you're smooth all over.

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.170
But yeah, I've heard that, too.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.620
The rich in hair and spirit thing.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:02.720
I've heard that, too.

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:05.930
Though I expelled it from my mind, as 
there was no profit to be gained from it.

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:07.320
That's right!

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.330
Wom-san is hairy, too!

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:11.510
I guess that's why you're so compassionate!

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:13.340
Please, desist!

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:15.650
I don't itch anywhere!

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:17.480
No, I bet you're itchy right here!

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:24.910
I'm extremely unamused.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:27.430
I want Hakone Yumoto extremely gone.

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:30.370
Haru, I know what you're thinking.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:34.080
<b>Monster</b>

00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:34.080
You want to create a monster 
to stamp him out, right?

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.920
Yes, yes! That, that!

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.260
In that case...

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:41.340
Let's make one.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:48.010
Today's a minced chicken and egg lunch! Yeah!

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:51.500
Gora-san's handmade lunches always 
look delicious, don't they?

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:52.850
They're the best!

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.510
I usually eat rice balls, so once in a while,

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:57.200
he goes out of his way 
to pack a lunch for me.

00:04:58.130 --> 00:04:59.520
Let's eat!

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:02.690
Huh? There's no spoon...

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:09.380
You want a bite of my chicken and egg lunch?

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:11.820
<i>I want it...</i>

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.500
<i>I want it so bad!</i>

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:17.370
No, thank you.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:20.320
That lunch wasn't made for us.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:28.220
This is why I didn't want to 
have lunch at the cafeteria.

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:32.100
But going out of my way to avoid 
him gets under my skin, too.

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:34.930
I can't say I don't sympathise...

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:36.120
Right?

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:37.630
I hate them!

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:39.180
Loves me...

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.520
hates me...

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:41.790
loves me...

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:42.860
It appears someone's here.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.380
hates me...

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:44.960
loves me...

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:46.780
hates me...

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.450
You. What are you doing?

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:54.400
I do beg your pardon!

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:58.120
I was performing, how do you say, 
the Japanese flower fortunetelling!

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:01.840
Picking flowers in a greenhouse 
seems rather tasteless...

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.580
I beg your utmost pardon!

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:09.420
I was worried about whether my twin 
younger brother loves or hates me.

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:11.220
And before I could think twice, I 
began plucking the flower's petals.

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:13.590
Your twin younger brother?

00:06:13.590 --> 00:06:15.430
You're twins, too?

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:16.540
Yes!

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:18.510
My name is Bernardo.

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:20.120
My little brother is Alan.

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:22.080
We are the pretty-boy Italian twins,

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:24.150
acknowledged by both ourselves and others!

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:30.130
If you're twins,

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:32.420
can't you just tell what he's thinking?

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:35.240
We never run into that problem.

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:38.250
I am so full of envy!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:41.650
We were not always this way!

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:43.060
What a waste.

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:45.000
Twins, of all people, 
should always get along.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.850
Indeed!

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:50.690
Twins must always get along!

00:06:50.690 --> 00:06:55.470
And yet I cannot understand 
anything my brother is thinking!

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:58.280
How did that happen?

00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:00.840
You did something to make 
him hate you, right?

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:02.220
It cannot be!

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:05.210
How can my brother hate me,
when I love him so?

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:08.610
But your brother must have some reason.

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:10.140
That's right.

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:11.260
Because without a reason...

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:14.000
Twins would never, ever hate each other!

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.700
Even if the world turned upside-down...

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:19.080
We'd still be of one mind in all things.

00:07:20.010 --> 00:07:22.350
What lovely twinly love!

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:24.880
That is what I would like to have!

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:27.590
And yet Alan...

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:31.970
he will not even meet my gaze!

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:37.600
And so, Bernardo told his story.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:43.230
They actually used to be the best of friends.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:46.040
But when they hit puberty,

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:48.540
the little brother changed.

00:07:49.390 --> 00:07:52.900
Brother, I will no longer 
take baths with you!

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:54.400
Why not, Alan?

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:55.570
Brother...

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:58.540
you cannot understand how I feel!

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:00.120
Since then,

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:03.780
we have never once bathed together.

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:05.880
I wonder why not.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.630
I cannot understand!

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:09.030
It's a mystery, then?

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:10.100
Yeah.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:13.300
It's hard for perfect twins 
like us to understand.

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:16.600
But these estranged twins could be useful.

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:18.390
Good point.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:21.430
I beg of you to help me!

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:25.770
And so we quickly began trailing 
the younger brother, Alan.

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:27.980
There's Alan!

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:30.320
He does look a lot like Bernardo.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:32.490
<b>Alan Salvatore</b>

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:33.320
They're as identical as we are.

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:34.820
Alan!

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:39.280
I heard they have hot springs in Italy, too!

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:43.500
My brother says they're called thermae!

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:46.200
And what of it?

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:49.090
The truth is, we run a thermae too!

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:52.500
You can come by with your 
twin brother some time!

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:54.540
Here, a coupon!

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:57.060
The answer is no!

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:59.970
I will never go to a thermae with my brother!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.930
Never!

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:01.930
What's wrong?

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:06.900
Hakone Yumoto appears to 
have stepped on a landmine.

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.040
Yes.

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:10.860
It appears that what Bernardo said was true.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:18.870
<b>The Piercing Prince
Battle Lover Epinard
Finishing Move: Epinard Love Hurricane</b>

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:21.030
Could we have a word?

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:23.910
What is it?

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:26.220
We are the Beppu siblings.

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:28.340
We're twins, like you.

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:30.290
So what?

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:32.760
Why do you hate your brother?

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:34.590
H-How did you know...

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:37.020
Bernardo told us.

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:39.010
He's worried about you.

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:42.660
My brother could never 
understand my feelings.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:45.690
And neither would perfect 
twins such as yourselves!

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:48.400
Well, I agree that we're perfect...

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:51.550
But we are entirely different!

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:53.370
There is a wall between my brother and I

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:57.030
that none could ever surmount!

00:09:57.270 --> 00:09:59.420
We're sorry to pry,

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:04.530
but could you tell us why it 
is that you hate your brother?

00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:06.750
As fellow twins, perhaps we could help.

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:08.920
I do not wish to say it.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:13.960
It is too shameful a 
thing for an Italian boy!

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.950
For an Italian boy?

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:16.760
What does that mean?

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:19.800
Do not poke at my inferiority complex!

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:21.110
Oh?

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:24.200
But I'm sure we'd be able to help.

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:27.920
We're very helpful to people with complexes.

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:30.680
Yes, we always side with people 
going through hard times.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:31.810
In other words...

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:34.780
We're on your side!

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:40.530
You are the first people who 
have ever said such a thing.

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:44.160
My brother is a good man, 
and very considerate.

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:48.000
But my brother has something which I lack.

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:49.270
I see.

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:51.820
That would cause an inferiority complex.

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:55.560
Then why don't you just take it from him?

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:58.470
But such a thing cannot be stolen...

00:10:58.660 --> 00:10:59.860
It can.

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:01.960
If you let us help you, at least.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:02.970
Truly?

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:04.330
Truly!

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:05.890
So, what is it...

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.020
...that you want?

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:10.230
Chest hair.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:11.160
Huh?

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:12.340
Chest hair?

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:16.750
But yes, we'll find a way to help you.

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:17.780
Truly?

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:18.880
Yes.

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:22.490
If you hate your brother, from the bottom 
of your heart, for his chest hair.

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:25.040
Yes, I hate it.

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:27.410
He has such a fine chest full of hair!

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.660
I envy him, and at the same time, hate him!

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:30.850
Then...

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:33.420
...we'll grant your wish.

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:44.380
<i> Welcome to the VEPP Theater.</i>

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:45.350
What?!

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:53.650
<i>VEPPer, the twin stars 
racing through the galaxy!</i>

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:57.000
<i>Moon and sun, miracles and secrets</i>

00:11:57.000 --> 00:12:00.300
<i>We're the stars making wishes come true!</i>

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:06.840
<i>VEPPer, the twin stars 
racing through the galaxy!</i>

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:05.280
Galaxy Idols, the VEPPer!

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.700
Chosen warrior!

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:10.220
<i>Let's illuminate the mysteries 
of the universe...</i>

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:09.660
Lucky you!

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:11.620
Happy you!

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:13.580
<i>On the name of the stars!</i>

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:13.920
Shooting...

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:15.830
Star!

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:25.530
Now we set him on Hakone Yumoto, 
and let him tear him to pieces.

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:28.260
<i>Hair</i> him to pieces, you mean.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:32.480
Suffer! Feel the pain!

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:37.840
The True Lovracelets!

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:41.490
Everyone, let's Love Making!

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.810
Love Making!

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:11.390
The Sparkling Prince!

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.680
Battle Lover Scarlet!

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.020
Love Making.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.360
The Flashing Prince!

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:29.480
Battle Lover Cerulean!

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:32.110
Love Making.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:41.750
The Piercing Prince!

00:13:42.190 --> 00:13:44.050
Battle Lover Epinard!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:46.850
Love Making.

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:56.620
The Roaring Prince!

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:59.100
Battle Lover Sulfur!

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:01.600
Love Making!

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.120
The Thrilling Prince!

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:13.520
Battle Lover Vesta!

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.240
This love-filled planet

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:29.260
will not abide those who lack love!

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:31.250
Those who wield loveless power

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:32.970
must kneel before love!

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:34.620
Love is power!

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:36.180
Love is hope!

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:37.850
Be born for love!

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.640
Give your life for love!

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:40.810
Love!

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:43.530
We are, forever, the heirs 
to the throne of love...

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:45.070
Battle Lovers!

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:46.830
Feel the power...

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:48.730
of love!

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:52.780
Behold my luxurious chest hair!

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:55.490
I am Chest Hair Monster Alan!

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:57.950
You are the ones who will feel the power!

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:00.460
He said his real name.

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:01.940
Yes, he did.

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:03.520
But what did he say?

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:04.920
That's chest hair?

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:07.750
If he says it is, I guess it is.

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:08.670
Overdoing it, isn't he?

00:15:08.870 --> 00:15:10.130
Over-overdoing it.

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:13.890
Overdoing it so badly, you couldn't pay me ten 
million yen to look straight at it.

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:16.720
You! How did you become a monster?

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:18.400
Who did this to you?

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:20.860
That does not matter!

00:15:20.860 --> 00:15:24.010
I will defeat you to vent my complex

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:26.440
over my brother's chest hair!

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:29.670
He just stated his motivation 
in the clearest terms possible.

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:31.860
Though it's still incomprehensible.

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:35.780
I don't even care if someone 
has chest hair or not.

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:39.180
Clean-shaven is more the fashion 
nowadays anyway, right?

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:41.830
Yeah. I can't understand it.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.210
You could never understand!

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:47.110
I kind of do!

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:47.920
What?!

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:49.120
Seriously?

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:50.420
He understands?

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:51.680
Yeah!

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:55.040
Because my brother Gora is hairy and manly,

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:57.470
and I'm a little jealous of that!

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:01.850
Is Gora-san hairier than he looks?

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:04.040
He is very manly, after all.

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:05.860
I never knew!

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:09.160
I really can't stand Hakone Yumoto.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:11.520
How dare he know everything about Gora-san!

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.850
Get him, Chest Hair Monster!

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:15.200
Attack!

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:18.160
Take this! Hairball Beam!

00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:21.830
What?!

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.380
Oh, boy... are you kidding me?

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:24.580
This is really something...

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:25.920
What's going on?!

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:27.130
Please don't look!

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:29.920
This is all extremely embarrassing!

00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:33.700
Behold, the power of the Hairball Beam!

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.160
How funny!

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:39.810
A plan to weaken the enemy 
through embarrassment?

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:45.010
Next, I will give you fantastic chest hair!

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:48.310
Chained Chest Hair Beam!

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:50.990
Chained? What?

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:52.780
I don't understand.

00:16:57.840 --> 00:17:00.260
Oh, is that what "chained" means?

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:02.290
I don't think this is the 
best time to be impressed.

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:06.720
Are you not happy to have 
such wonderful chest hair?

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:08.300
No, not at all!

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:10.380
What do we do about this, anyway?

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:12.870
Is doing this really making you happy?

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:14.130
What?!

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:16.420
I'm asking!

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:18.680
Is having that fake chest hair, 
giving us fake chest hair...

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:20.560
Does that really make you happy?

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.380
Of course it does!

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:24.610
Chest hair is everything!

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:26.710
Chest hair is what makes you an Italian boy!

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:29.060
Bravo, chest hair!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:31.360
So, what do we do about this?

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:33.140
This monster's a real pain.

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:36.940
When they start getting annoying, 
don't we usually just purge them?

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:39.030
We wave our little sticks and end it!

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:42.840
You guys are really raring to go for once!

00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:43.910
No!

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:46.550
Um... why not, exactly?

00:17:46.550 --> 00:17:48.500
Even if we beat him,

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:51.740
it won't cure him of his 
complex about his big brother!

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:54.210
We need to get them to make up!

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:56.760
I can't entirely deny the logic there...

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:57.930
In other words...

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.200
Wom-san, find his big brother!

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:02.390
Roger that!

00:18:03.480 --> 00:18:05.790
So do we just stay like this until then?

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:08.050
It appears that we do.

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:13.080
You make a grand sight 
with all that chest hair!

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.360
Everyone!

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:19.760
Here is the monster's brother, Bernardo-san!

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:20.700
That was fast.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.240
<i>Too</i> fast!

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:23.620
That's our Wom-san!

00:18:24.940 --> 00:18:26.960
Alan... is that you, Alan?!

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:28.730
Yes it is, brother!

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:31.600
But I am no longer the Alan you once knew!

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:34.960
Look at this magnificent 
chest hair that I have now!

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:38.840
I cannot even comprehend why he wants that.

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:42.520
I'm even more baffled than when 
one of my investments failed.

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:43.300
Bernardo!

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:45.970
You're the only one who can save him!

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:47.760
You're his big brother!

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:50.010
Alan...

00:18:50.010 --> 00:18:53.480
I had no idea that my chest hair 
was causing you so much pain!

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:55.330
It is just as I said!

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:58.190
You could not understand how I feel!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.330
We were twins, with the 
same face, the same body,

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:05.810
always with the same thoughts 
and the same dreams!

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:09.660
So why am I the only one 
deprived of chest hair?!

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:11.720
Is that why you

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:14.980
would no longer go to the thermae with me?

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:16.030
That is right!

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:18.920
Your chest hair was so 
dazzling and so enviable,

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.630
I could no longer stand to see it!

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:23.280
Then...

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:25.780
I no longer need chest hair!

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:26.470
What?!

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:28.580
I say that if I must lose one of you...

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:31.600
I would rather lose the chest hair!

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:32.380
You lie!

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:34.770
I know that you secretly take 
great pride in your chest hair!

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:36.320
It is no lie!

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:40.030
I shall prove it to you now!

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:45.180
This pain is nothing!

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:47.020
This took a turn for the amazing.

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:49.610
That's got to sting a little.

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:52.210
No, it's probably extremely painful.

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:54.120
But he's enduring it!

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:58.410
Because he wants to make up with his 
little brother, even if it hurts!

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:00.340
<i>This</i> is bringing tears to your eyes?

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:02.820
Damn that Hakone Yumoto.

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:04.220
He got in our way!

00:20:04.610 --> 00:20:05.680
That wolf in sheep's clothing...

00:20:06.070 --> 00:20:07.180
You!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:10.220
Do you see the pain your brother's in?

00:20:10.220 --> 00:20:12.900
But he's enduring it

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:15.150
because he loves you so much!

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:17.150
He wants to make amends

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:20.110
and restore your loving sibling relationship!

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:21.190
That is right!

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:22.900
To get that back,

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:25.750
I would sacrifice many 
hundreds of chest hairs!

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:27.590
Please, stop it!

00:20:27.940 --> 00:20:30.180
I... It is my fault!

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:33.040
Please stop, my brother!

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:34.840
They made up?

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:37.090
But we're still stuck here?

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:40.000
I guess we actually have to purge him.

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:42.340
Okay then, everyone! Now!

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:43.220
Yeah!

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:46.800
Sparkle, Lumiere of Love!

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.560
Flash, Purifying Aqua!

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:55.020
Pierce, Gallant Hurricane!

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:58.230
Roar, Raging Gaia!

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:01.440
Thrill, Blazing Ignit!

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:10.680
True Love Fountain!

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:25.090
Love is over!

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:28.900
Brother!

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:33.810
Thank goodness!

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:36.390
Hey! Yumoto!

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:38.440
Brother!

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:40.250
What's wrong?

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:44.040
I forgot to include the 
spoon for your lunch today.

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:44.980
Brother!

00:21:44.980 --> 00:21:47.280
Thank you! But I already finished it.

00:21:47.440 --> 00:21:48.450
I see.

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:49.510
Well done.

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:52.790
I know what you're thinking.

00:21:53.490 --> 00:21:54.300
Yeah.

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:56.510
Don't worry.

00:21:56.510 --> 00:22:00.040
You, the Beppu siblings, are the strongest.

00:22:00.620 --> 00:22:01.590
Yeah.

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:03.590
<b>Kurotama Bath</b>

00:22:05.540 --> 00:22:06.400
Huh?

00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:09.200
Bernardo's chest hair is back to normal!

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:11.760
It must be the power of the Love Fountain!

00:22:12.020 --> 00:22:14.220
Can it do that?

00:22:14.220 --> 00:22:15.480
I guess it can.

00:22:16.760 --> 00:22:18.980
That's my dear big brother!

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:20.150
Alan...

00:22:20.640 --> 00:22:23.120
I'm so glad you're friends again!

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:27.110
I'm not going to say another word on this.

00:24:00.810 --> 00:24:05.730
Accept Love

00:24:00.810 --> 00:24:05.730
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:01.830 --> 00:24:04.040
Next time, "Accept Love!"

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:05.410
Love Making!
